       belongs in the solution for a reason that cost a red CI: a project that is only *referenced* is built
       with the default configuration even when the solution is built with -c Release, so the spec looked for
       a Release binary the solution never produced (TASK-343, fixed after the v0.20.0 publication run). -->
  <Project Path="tests/Aiko.Infrastructure.Specs/Fixtures/SilentDaemon/SilentDaemon.csproj" />
